Projects/UOContent/Multis/Houses/BaseHouse.cs

Tells the tiered navigation when a house is raised, moved or taken down (NavigationService.GroundChanged), beside the
spawn-cache call already there, so the clusters under it are drawn again from the ground. Without this patch the
navigation graph keeps the ground as it was when it was drawn.

WHY. Patrick's order of 26.09.2026 and the design he sent with it: houses are an overlay on the static graph, rebuilt
when they change.

diff --git a/Projects/UOContent/Multis/Houses/BaseHouse.cs b/Projects/UOContent/Multis/Houses/BaseHouse.cs
index 19e9c020c..1df0d6e35 100644
--- a/Projects/UOContent/Multis/Houses/BaseHouse.cs
+++ b/Projects/UOContent/Multis/Houses/BaseHouse.cs
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@
